OL,3,GNEWSASir Norman Wisdom memorabilia set
OL,4,Afor auction
OL,5,
OL,6,FRare memorabilia owned by a comedy
OL,7,Flegend who grew up in Kent is due to go
OL,8,Funder the hammer at auction.
OL,10,FSir Norman Wisdom, who lived as a
OL,11,Ffoster child with his brother in Deal,
OL,12,Fdied in 2010 at the age of 95 after a
OL,13,Fstoried career in the entertainment
OL,14,Findustry.
OL,16,FAmong the items being auctioned in
OL,17,FDerby on Friday is Wisdom's original
OL,18,Fbrown tweed Gump suit worn between 1948
OL,19,Fand 1953, early handwritten scripts,
OL,20,Fphotographs, and theatre memorabilia.
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
